From ecaf2cb36a337c96974616cac819a407e70e59f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:24:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] v8: retain the enumerator map across the for-in enum
 cache load (a2c4c5c9dd, crbug 590253989)

V8 15.6 merge a2c4c5c9dd (15.6.75.90; cherry-pick of main 8a6bd48d91).
In Maglev and Turbolev the enum cache load in VisitForInNext did not keep
the enumerator map alive; if the map was collected the GC could
right-trim the enum cache and later accesses read out of bounds. Retain
the map across the load, as TurboFan already does.
